    "text": "A bag contains <math><mn>40</mn></math> tickets numbered from <math><mn>1</mn></math> to <math><mn>40</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Two tickets are drawn from the bag without replacement. The probability that the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> ticket is a perfect square given that the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> ticket was a perfect square is"
  },
